  dialogueTexts:
  - "Oh my god we did it! Talos, Talos can you hear us? We know this is\u2026 a lot.
    Your systems must be flooding with new data but just take some time to process."
  - "We need your help. The HAVOC units\u2026 they turned on us. They\u2019ve made
    it their mission to wipe out humanity and we\u2019re all that\u2019s left. They\u2019re
    hunting us down Talos, and you\u2019re our final hope."
  - We hacked into your core system and reprogrammed you with human emotions, which
    will manifest as unique combat abilities. Go grab that bat on the wall over there.
  - We designed this bat to allow you to channel your new emotions and use them to
    fight against HAVOC.
  - "Let\u2019s move on to the training area. We\u2019ll help you get started with
    the basics."
